     "content": "The user wants me to plan evidence queries for round 2 for crime CHN-GU-2025-001149. The skeptic feedback highlights issues with a potential link to CHN-ST-2025-001108: identical suspect description (3 heavy-build males 25-35) and knife use are generic; vehicle match lacks plates (both null) so vehicle score 0.5 rests only on make/model/color plus ANPR trail with no plate confirmation; MO missing entirely for CHN-ST-2025-001108, leaving no behavioural signature to corroborate the posed_as_ride_hailing_cab approach. Space-time (2.3 km, 10 days) is plausible but not distinctive.\n\nWe need to plan queries to address these gaps. The skeptic wants more evidence: vehicle plate confirmation, MO for the other crime, maybe more details.\n\nWe have the case data for CHN-GU-2025-001149. We need to run queries to gather more evidence. Since round 2, we can adjust parameters. The prior vetted answers show examples of planning steps. We must output JSON with steps.\n\nWe need to consider what queries to run. The skeptic feedback mentions:\n- Vehicle match lacks plates (both null) - but our case has plate TN22??7312. The other crime CHN-ST-2025-001108 has no plates. We could run q_vehicle_trail for our plate pattern to see if it appears near the other crime location/time.\n- MO missing for CHN-ST-2025-001108 - we could run q_candidates with maybe narrower window? But q_candidates is recall step. Could run q_offender_return with MO tags from our case to see if any known offenders match.\n- Also q_calls_near, q_tip_corroboration, q_news, q_context for both crimes? But we only have crime_id for our case. The system might allow querying for other crime IDs? The queries take crime_id param. We could run q_candidates again with different parameters? The instruction says q_candidates must come first. At least days 45 and ring 6. Could adjust days/ring based on skeptic? The skeptic says space-time 2.3 km, 10 days. That's within 45 days and 6 km. So maybe we need to run q_candidates again with same parameters to get candidates? But we already have a candidate pair. The skeptic wants more evidence to corroborate.\n\nWe can run:\n1. q_candidates (again) with maybe days 45, ring 6 (or maybe narrower? But instruction says at least days 45 and ring 6, narrower only when Skeptic asks. The skeptic didn't ask for narrower, but they questioned the link. We could keep same.)\n2. q_vehicle_trail for our plate pattern TN22??7312 around the time of both crimes? The other crime occurred when? Not given. But we can approximate. The skeptic says 10 days apart. Our crime occurred 2025-10-07 01:09. The other crime likely around 2025-09-27 or 2025-10-17. We can set a wider window.\n3. q_offender_return with MO tags from our case, ward 170, since 90 days before.\n4. q_calls_near for our crime_id.\n5. q_tip_corroboration for our crime_id.\n6. q_news for our crime_id.\n7. q_context for our crime_id.\n8. q_dq_flags maybe for the candidate pair? But we don't have IDs.\n\nWe need at most 8 steps. q_candidates first.\n\nLet's construct parameters.\n\nq_candidates: crime_id CHN-GU-2025-001149, days 45, ring 6.\n\nq_vehicle_trail: plate_pattern \"TN22??7312\", t0 and t1 covering a window around both crimes. Since we don't know exact date of other crime, we can set t0 a week before our crime (2025-09-30) and t1 a week after (2025-10-14). Or maybe wider: 2025-09-20 to 2025-10-20. Use cells maybe include h3_r9 of our crime and maybe neighboring cells? But we only have our h3_r9. Could include that.\n\nq_offender_return: mo_tags from our MO: approach, escape, offender_count, place_type, target, target_item, time_band, violence. Convert to tags: \"posed_as_ride_hailing_cab\", \"drove_away_in_car\", \"offender_count_3\", \"hotel_nearby_or_parking\", \"late_night_passenger\", \"cash_and_mobile_phone\", \"night\", \"knife_shown_to_threaten\". Ward 170. Since 90 days before our crime: 2025-07-09.\n\nq_calls_near: crime_id CHN-GU-2025-001149.\n\nq_tip_corroboration: crime_id CHN-GU-2025-001149.\n\nq_news: crime_id CHN-GU-2025-001149.\n\nq_context: crime_id CHN-GU-2025-001149.\n\nThat's 7 steps. Could also include q_dq_flags but we don't have ids yet. Might skip.\n\nNow construct JSON. Ensure each step has name, params, why.\n\nI'll write the JSON.</think>{\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_candidates\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"crime_id\": \"CHN-GU-2025-001149\",\n        \"days\": 45,\n        \"ring\": 6\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Re-run candidate recall to confirm the CHN-ST-2025-001108 link and see if any other similar crimes appear within the same space-time window\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_vehicle_trail\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"plate_pattern\": \"TN22??7312\",\n        \"t0\": \"2025-09-20T00:00:00+05:30\",\n        \"t1\": \"2025-10-20T00:00:00+05:30\",\n        \"cells\": [\"89618c4f137ffff\"]\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Track the suspect vehicle (white Maruti Swift Dzire, partial plate TN22??7312) across a 30-day window covering both crimes to confirm plate presence near the other crime location\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_offender_return\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"mo_tags\": [\n          \"posed_as_ride_hailing_cab\",\n          \"drove_away_in_car\",\n          \"offender_count_3\",\n          \"hotel_nearby_or_parking\",\n          \"late_night_passenger\",\n          \"cash_and_mobile_phone\",\n          \"night\",\n          \"knife_shown_to_threaten\"\n        ],\n        \"ward\": 170,\n        \"since\": \"2025-07-09T00:00:00+05:30\"\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Check for known offenders with this exact MO returning to ward 170 in the 90 days before the crime, which could link to the other case if the same group is active\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_calls_near\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"crime_id\": \"CHN-GU-2025-001149\"\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Identify emergency calls near the crime scene for witness leads that might describe the vehicle or suspects\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_tip_corroboration\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"crime_id\": \"CHN-GU-2025-001149\"\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Corroborate any tips received for this case that might mention the other crime or the vehicle\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_news\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"crime_id\": \"CHN-GU-2025-001149\"\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Check media coverage for additional details or public appeals that might reference the linked crime\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"q_context\",\n      \"params\": {\n        \"crime_id\": \"CHN-GU-2025-001149\"\n      },\n      \"why\": \"Gather contextual information about the crime location and time to support the space-time proximity argument\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
